<SiteLayout title="Our Story | Otter Homecare" description="Why Jamie started Otter Homecare — kinder, more personal home care born from caring for his own father. Our mission, values, and the otter behind the name.">
<header class="phero"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> · About · Our Story</div><h1>It started with caring for my own father</h1><p>Otter Homecare was founded from personal experience and a deep belief in compassionate, family-centred care.</p></div></header>
<section class="section founder"><div class="wrap"><div class="pic reveal"><img src="/img/promise-dad.jpg" alt="Jamie, our founder, with his father"></div><div class="reveal"><h2>Why I started Otter Homecare</h2><blockquote>After growing up in Wiltshire, I spent my twenties and thirties in Thailand — a culture where caring for older loved ones at home, surrounded by family, was simply the way of life. When I returned and my father suffered a severe stroke, it felt only natural to care for him at home, surrounded by familiar faces, dignity and love. Supervising his support team opened my eyes to the real power of empathetic, human-focused care — not just for the person being supported, but for the whole family. Otter Homecare grew from that.</blockquote><div class="sig">Jamie Rowland-Jones<span>Founder, Otter Homecare</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:520px;text-align:center"><img src="/img/jamie-thailand.png" alt="Jamie in Thailand" style="display:block;width:100%;border-radius:var(--r-lg);box-shadow:var(--shadow)"><p style="margin-top:14px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);font-style:italic">Jamie in Thailand — where caring for older loved ones at home, surrounded by family, is simply a way of life.</p></div></section>

<section class="section tmt"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;text-align:center"><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Our mission</span><h2 style="font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);margin:10px 0 0">To deliver care rooted in kindness, respect and compassion — bringing comfort, trust and connection into homes across Wiltshire and Somerset.</h2></div></div></section>
<section class="section "><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px"><div class="head-c reveal"><span class="eyebrow">In Jamie's words</span><h2>Why I started Otter Homecare</h2></div><div class="video-embed reveal" data-yt="XDrJalkjfkg" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Play video: Why I started Otter Homecare"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/XDrJalkjfkg/maxresdefault.jpg" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src=&#39;https://img.youtube.com/vi/XDrJalkjfkg/hqdefault.jpg&#39;" alt="Jamie, founder of Otter Homecare, speaking to camera"><span class="playbtn"><span></span></span><span class="vlabel">Watch: Why I started Otter</span></div></div></section>
